WEBVTT

00:00:02.410 --> 00:00:03.890
It's summer vacation!

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.800
It's summer vacation, so it's time 
to level up your training!

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:09.150
Let's do our best!

00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:10.260
Yeah...

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.950
<i>And so, the summer vacation 
of my sophomore year began.</i>

00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:17.930
Huh? Is this new?

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:20.320
It's hard!

00:00:22.470 --> 00:00:23.960
<i>What is this?</i>

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.100
<i>I don't get it.</i>

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.500
<i>I can't see it because of the water!</i>

00:01:58.010 --> 00:02:03.640
<b>Thirteenth Haunting 
Metamorphosis</b>

00:01:58.080 --> 00:02:04.010
<i>Namu... oriya... boryokichi... shikuraya...</i>

00:02:04.390 --> 00:02:06.310
<i>Fujisato boya...</i>

00:02:06.570 --> 00:02:10.240
You're probably frustrated over being 
unable to read it, but control yourself!

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.470
Self-control!

00:02:11.470 --> 00:02:12.830
<i>I know...</i>

00:02:12.830 --> 00:02:14.890
<i>That's supposed to be the training.</i>

00:02:15.160 --> 00:02:17.830
<i>But why is it s-so cold?</i>

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:19.550
<i>This can't be happening.</i>

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:22.610
<i>Training always passes so fast,</i>

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:25.030
<i>but my body aches and the water's so cold!</i>

00:02:25.030 --> 00:02:27.200
<i>Sahara...</i>

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.200
Self-control!

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:30.030
<i>Danno donsha...</i>

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:31.980
<i>Namashukyuri...</i>

00:02:34.400 --> 00:02:35.790
<i>It's so long...</i>

00:02:36.130 --> 00:02:37.490
<i>I can't see the end.</i>

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:39.910
<i>I can't breathe!</i>

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:41.130
Self-control!

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:42.400
<i>Calm down.</i>

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.550
<i>Self-control... Self-control. 
Self-control. Self-control!</i>

00:02:45.550 --> 00:02:47.990
Okay! That's all, Yushi-kun!

00:02:51.470 --> 00:02:53.140
Are you all right, Yushi-kun?

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.590
<i>My body feels like it's falling apart.</i>

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:58.960
<i>I can't believe my new training is so hard!</i>

00:02:58.960 --> 00:03:00.690
You probably can't move yet.

00:03:00.690 --> 00:03:03.140
Okay, Akira-san, you do it!

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:05.800
Leave it to me.

00:03:05.800 --> 00:03:07.480
<i>Don't tell me...</i>

00:03:08.050 --> 00:03:10.630
<i>How did I know he'd carry 
me like a princess?!</i>

00:03:11.110 --> 00:03:13.320
Warm up in the bath, okay?

00:03:13.320 --> 00:03:14.610
Okay, off we go!

00:03:14.870 --> 00:03:17.960
<i>This training is too hard in a lot of ways!</i>

00:03:21.110 --> 00:03:22.900
Thanks, Akira-san...

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:23.970
Sure thing.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.420
You're working hard this morning, Yushi-kun.

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:27.350
Ryu-san!

00:03:27.350 --> 00:03:29.220
Oh, you're back?

00:03:29.220 --> 00:03:31.810
I wondered why everyone was so quiet.

00:03:31.810 --> 00:03:34.190
I heard you leveled your training up.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:36.230
And you couldn't stand at the end?

00:03:36.480 --> 00:03:37.930
N-No...

00:03:37.930 --> 00:03:40.730
Yushi-kun, you liked that bath, right?

00:03:40.730 --> 00:03:42.150
Stop it!

00:03:42.620 --> 00:03:44.900
Then, I'll take you to the bath tomorrow.

00:03:45.400 --> 00:03:46.680
I refuse!

00:03:46.680 --> 00:03:49.370
What? Akira-san can, but I can't?

00:03:49.830 --> 00:03:51.320
That isn't it!

00:03:51.660 --> 00:03:53.020
Okay, that's enough!

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:54.010
Breakfast time!

00:03:54.010 --> 00:03:54.990
I've been waiting!

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:56.920
Bean-flavored fried fish.

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:59.650
Egg tofu with summer vegetables!

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.890
Spinach and chrysanthemum salad 
with white miso dressing...

00:04:01.890 --> 00:04:03.680
Fried pork and bean sprouts.

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:06.930
Clam soup and lightly pickled eggplant!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.310
I love the smell of vinegar.

00:04:09.310 --> 00:04:11.420
Perfect after a night of heavy drinking.

00:04:11.420 --> 00:04:13.810
And a special dish for Yushi-kun!

00:04:13.810 --> 00:04:16.360
Salad with herbs and thinly sliced beef!

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:18.750
Wow! Let's eat!

00:04:20.150 --> 00:04:22.220
Good morning! Smells good!

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:23.980
You're back, Ryu-san.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:25.180
I just got back.

00:04:25.180 --> 00:04:27.830
Akira-san, you're up early this morning...

00:04:27.830 --> 00:04:29.320
You're already drinking?

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:31.710
You have beer after a bath, right?

00:04:41.910 --> 00:04:43.480
You're awake?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.090
H-Huh?

00:04:45.090 --> 00:04:48.520
You fell asleep during breakfast.

00:04:48.520 --> 00:04:50.640
Like a baby!

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:52.720
Again?

00:04:53.310 --> 00:04:55.810
You're up, Yushi-kun? How do you feel?

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.850
I feel great now!

00:04:57.850 --> 00:04:59.650
Well, being young is nice...

00:04:59.650 --> 00:05:03.780
Kids his age absorb and 
digest everything, huh?

00:05:04.240 --> 00:05:06.210
And they keep growing and changing.

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:07.840
Isn't it amazing to watch?

00:05:07.840 --> 00:05:09.450
I-Is it?

00:05:09.640 --> 00:05:12.360
Right now, he's a gem, 
waiting to be polished.

00:05:13.780 --> 00:05:15.560
<i>I'm a gem?</i>

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.190
<i>And so, a week passed.</i>

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:44.950
<i>Namunorakinjikirimokokodoshamisabo.</i>

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.540
Okay, all done.

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:48.870
Already?

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:50.880
Yeah, I think you've gotten used to it.

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:51.870
That was fast.

00:05:52.500 --> 00:05:54.940
Appears you can get to the 
bath on your own today.

00:05:54.940 --> 00:05:57.620
Ryu-san! Right, I'm fine!

00:05:57.620 --> 00:05:58.680
I see...

00:05:58.680 --> 00:06:01.880
But if it's hard, I'll hold you 
on the way again.

00:06:01.880 --> 00:06:02.910
I'm fine! I'm fine!

00:06:02.910 --> 00:06:04.070
I'll pass!

00:06:04.720 --> 00:06:06.480
That's a shame.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.800
<b>Men</b>

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:11.190
This feels so good...

00:06:12.470 --> 00:06:15.460
<i>My whole body feels filled with power.</i>

00:06:15.940 --> 00:06:17.140
<i>Is this...</i>

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:22.070
Master, I am glad to see you working 
so hard at your training.

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.050
Oh, Fool...

00:06:23.320 --> 00:06:26.950
I feel an excellent aura from you now!

00:06:26.950 --> 00:06:29.000
It is, I believe, the result 
of your training.

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:30.330
I see.

00:06:30.680 --> 00:06:32.150
That's right!

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:36.750
<i>Been a while. Guess I'll weigh myself.</i>

00:06:36.750 --> 00:06:39.390
<i>Last time, I was 55 kilograms...</i>

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:43.930
<i>Forty-five?</i>

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:48.420
<i>I've lost 10 kilograms.</i>

00:06:50.340 --> 00:06:53.240
Hey, Yushi... Your body...

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:56.090
What is this?!

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.800
Is this a boxing manga?

00:07:00.320 --> 00:07:01.470
<i>It's no good.</i>

00:07:01.470 --> 00:07:07.010
<i>It's Ruriko-san's special breakfast, 
but I have no appetite...</i>

00:07:07.010 --> 00:07:08.990
<i>What's happened to my body?</i>

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:09.950
Yushi-kun...

00:07:10.740 --> 00:07:12.570
No training for today.

00:07:13.370 --> 00:07:14.900
You can rest.

00:07:16.370 --> 00:07:17.580
Okay.

00:07:21.480 --> 00:07:25.180
<i>I thought I'd leveled up.</i>

00:07:26.580 --> 00:07:28.800
<i>I wonder what Hase's doing...</i>

00:07:29.750 --> 00:07:32.520
If I'm remembering Hase at a time like this,

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.890
I haven't grown at all!

00:07:37.150 --> 00:07:38.060
Kuri?

00:07:39.180 --> 00:07:40.900
You want me to play?

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:43.410
Yeah.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:45.950
Okay, let's play a game!

00:07:47.220 --> 00:07:49.810
At times like this, thinking is useless!

00:07:51.270 --> 00:07:52.390
How about this?

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:54.650
Dinnertime!

00:08:01.490 --> 00:08:03.660
<i>I... I can eat it.</i>

00:08:03.660 --> 00:08:05.060
It's good, Ruriko-san!

00:08:05.060 --> 00:08:07.170
The soft, stewed Hamburg steak!

00:08:07.170 --> 00:08:09.280
I'm glad, Yushi-kun.

00:08:09.730 --> 00:08:12.070
Humans need to eat, huh?

00:08:12.070 --> 00:08:13.350
I'm so uncomplicated!

00:08:13.350 --> 00:08:15.430
To get by, you have to be.

00:08:16.160 --> 00:08:19.060
When you're young, both body 
and soul are unstable.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:22.550
You could face one direction yesterday, 
and an opposite one today.

00:08:22.550 --> 00:08:25.490
And you just do that, over and over.

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:29.820
But if you don't get lost, the world 
will remain small and won't grow.

00:08:29.820 --> 00:08:32.020
And that's really tiring!

00:08:35.480 --> 00:08:37.150
<i>It's okay to be lost.</i>

00:08:38.980 --> 00:08:41.700
<i>I thought I understood that, but...</i>

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.290
Chirp! Chirp! Chirp! Chirpity-chirp!

00:08:49.950 --> 00:08:51.420
Still not doing well?

00:08:51.740 --> 00:08:52.720
No.

00:08:52.720 --> 00:08:54.380
<i>I'm back to how I was.</i>

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:05.180
<i>Fool's always so annoying, but...</i>

00:09:06.060 --> 00:09:08.480
<i>I guess he can take a hint.</i>

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.450
<i>Damn it!</i>

00:09:29.220 --> 00:09:30.920
It feels so good!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:32.840
Aren't you glad we came?

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:35.010
The pool's the best way to 
spend the summer, huh?

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:36.990
What's wrong?

00:09:36.990 --> 00:09:39.210
I wonder if anyone I know is here...

00:09:40.140 --> 00:09:41.370
I guess not.

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:43.720
Hey, what do you think Inaba's doing?

00:09:43.720 --> 00:09:45.010
Working, probably?

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.740
He's working! I want to go see him!

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:49.450
That's a great idea!

00:09:49.450 --> 00:09:51.940
But he's a mover. Are you sure?

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:54.610
Never mind.

00:10:01.090 --> 00:10:03.780
<i>This feeling... I remember it.</i>

00:10:07.700 --> 00:10:09.660
<i>From when I was still at my uncle's house.</i>

00:10:10.740 --> 00:10:14.190
<i>From when bad things happened, 
and I wanted to take it out on someone.</i>

00:10:15.100 --> 00:10:17.960
<i>But I couldn't do it there.</i>

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.520
<i>So I left.</i>

00:10:20.130 --> 00:10:24.260
<i>Don't stop... Don't stop... 
Don't stop. Don't stop!</i>

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:34.360
<i>I haven't grown, have I?</i>

00:10:44.350 --> 00:10:45.550
<i>The sea...</i>

00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:52.390
<i>My training... Guess I don't 
have it again today.</i>

00:10:53.810 --> 00:10:55.340
<i>What time is it?</i>

00:10:56.190 --> 00:10:59.350
<i>I still... don't want to go back.</i>

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:10.390
<i>The sun's set...</i>

00:11:13.810 --> 00:11:14.620
Huh?

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:19.020
Fool? When did you...

00:11:19.290 --> 00:11:22.650
We are always with you, master.

00:11:26.160 --> 00:11:27.750
Guess it's time to go home!

00:11:28.530 --> 00:11:32.450
I have a lot of worries, and I 
did a lot of stupid stuff.

00:11:32.450 --> 00:11:33.770
You, too?

00:11:33.770 --> 00:11:35.000
Sure.

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:37.050
I went around breaking glass at school,

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:38.950
stole a bike, and went for a joyride.

00:11:38.950 --> 00:11:40.330
Yutaka Ozaki, right?

00:11:40.330 --> 00:11:42.380
I'm amazed you know that, Akine-chan.

00:11:42.380 --> 00:11:45.370
Well, my worries stopped 
when I got to high school.

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.300
Why?

00:11:47.770 --> 00:11:49.520
I found painting.

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:54.590
Of course, I'd have slumps, and maybe 
I had more to worry about...

00:11:54.590 --> 00:11:58.610
But I'd decided this was what I 
was going to do with my life.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:02.610
All my worries, uncertainty, and pain 
have become good memories.

00:12:03.520 --> 00:12:06.700
Even if I weren't a painter now.

00:12:08.370 --> 00:12:11.990
I don't know about worries, 
but I was always certain.

00:12:11.990 --> 00:12:13.570
You were?

00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:18.430
The day I was born, my life 
was as good as decided.

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:20.800
And I knew that.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:22.450
So I was always certain.

00:12:23.060 --> 00:12:24.840
Then, your worries...

00:12:24.840 --> 00:12:26.870
I simply had to overcome them.

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:30.800
If I hadn't, I couldn't have survived.

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:34.180
I guess I'm the same.

00:12:34.180 --> 00:12:37.140
My life has been decided, 
ever since I was very little.

00:12:37.140 --> 00:12:41.360
So no matter how hard things got, 
I was going to overcome them!

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.280
It's nice being young...

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:48.610
Youth is what lets you think 
that way, and then do it.

00:12:48.610 --> 00:12:50.170
What about you?

00:12:50.170 --> 00:12:53.250
I had no worries or uncertainty!

00:12:53.250 --> 00:12:55.010
I knew it!

00:12:56.620 --> 00:12:59.670
<i>Yeah... That's right.</i>

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:02.050
<i>This is what I was lacking.</i>

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:06.750
<i>I don't have the resolve to be 
a mage, no matter what.</i>

00:13:07.430 --> 00:13:08.550
<i>But...</i>

00:13:09.030 --> 00:13:12.500
<i>Akine-san has always been 
serious about training me.</i>

00:13:13.340 --> 00:13:15.300
<i>And when I couldn't move,</i>

00:13:15.300 --> 00:13:18.310
<i>Akira-san helped me, again and 
again, never looking bothered.</i>

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:22.370
<i>And Ryu-san called me a gem.</i>

00:13:23.430 --> 00:13:27.620
<i>But a gem only shines because 
someone polishes it.</i>

00:13:29.680 --> 00:13:32.140
<i>Even if I can't be a mage,</i>

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:36.490
<i>I want to believe the experience everyone's
 given me will be a good memory.</i>

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:41.300
<i>And for that, I'll make all this 
suffering a part of me.</i>

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.100
<i>That is my resolve!</i>

00:13:51.670 --> 00:13:52.660
Morning.

00:13:53.100 --> 00:13:54.440
Okay, let's get started.

00:13:54.440 --> 00:13:55.260
Right!

00:13:56.390 --> 00:13:59.610
<i>Namakaratannotorayaya.</i>

00:13:59.610 --> 00:14:03.490
<i>Nanoriyaboryokichishifuraya.</i>

00:14:10.970 --> 00:14:11.740
<i>I...</i>

00:14:11.740 --> 00:14:14.130
<i>I can see... myself?</i>

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.100
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:14:45.170 --> 00:14:48.390
<i>How... beautiful.</i>

00:14:58.870 --> 00:15:00.630
Okay, that's enough!

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:07.290
What's wrong, Yushi-kun?

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:11.420
Akine-san, I was above the sky.

00:15:11.420 --> 00:15:13.100
The light was streaming down...

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:16.000
That's called divine inspiration.

00:15:16.380 --> 00:15:18.050
Divine inspiration?

00:15:18.050 --> 00:15:21.370
The sense of liberation and pleasure you feel

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:24.320
when you've overcome your inner limits.

00:15:24.710 --> 00:15:27.350
Congratulations, Yushi-kun! 
You've leveled up!

00:15:27.800 --> 00:15:29.770
Really?

00:15:30.780 --> 00:15:33.360
Your weight decreased, you felt tired,

00:15:33.360 --> 00:15:36.520
or suddenly filled with energy.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:41.040
That instability was because of the 
load placed on you before growth.

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:43.260
But you're okay now!

00:15:43.520 --> 00:15:46.420
You knew about all this?

00:15:46.420 --> 00:15:47.210
Yeah.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.560
Why didn't you tell me?

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:52.900
If I had, it wouldn't have 
been training, would it?

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:54.460
You had to overcome it yourself.

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:57.450
But I was sure that you could!

00:15:58.520 --> 00:15:59.680
Thanks.

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:10.470
<i>My body feels light.</i>

00:16:10.470 --> 00:16:11.770
<i>It feels so good!</i>

00:16:11.770 --> 00:16:12.620
What?

00:16:14.520 --> 00:16:17.450
This is so good! Ruriko-san, this is amazing!

00:16:18.360 --> 00:16:20.350
Your appetite's amazing.

00:16:20.350 --> 00:16:22.450
Yeah! I'm totally back!

00:16:22.450 --> 00:16:24.990
No, I feel reborn!

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:28.400
I guess I'll be off.

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:29.960
Okay, good luck.

00:16:33.240 --> 00:16:34.460
Ryu-san, wait!

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:39.850
What's wrong, Yushi-kun?

00:16:40.260 --> 00:16:44.740
Ryu-san, were you staying for my sake?

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:48.810
Watching your growth was fun, Yushi-kun.

00:16:50.790 --> 00:16:53.450
You didn't choose magic.

00:16:53.750 --> 00:16:57.620
I am moved by the mysteries of your fate.

00:16:57.930 --> 00:17:00.440
But in reality, it's a difficult thing.

00:17:00.440 --> 00:17:02.990
So I'll help as much as I can.

00:17:03.820 --> 00:17:05.380
Thank you!

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:07.930
You're worth it.

00:17:09.620 --> 00:17:11.360
No matter what your fate,

00:17:11.360 --> 00:17:13.600
no matter what aid others give,

00:17:13.600 --> 00:17:17.880
in the end, only your own 
will can overcome it.

00:17:17.880 --> 00:17:21.150
Of course, some people cannot do it.

00:17:22.510 --> 00:17:27.820
But I offer no help to those 
who refuse to try.

00:17:29.570 --> 00:17:31.820
<i>He isn't only kind...</i>

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:34.490
<i>He's as stern as he is kind!</i>

00:17:35.830 --> 00:17:38.740
No one knows what the future holds.

00:17:39.310 --> 00:17:43.140
You will often worry and feel lost.

00:17:43.140 --> 00:17:45.790
But never give up.

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:48.250
Right.

00:17:48.820 --> 00:17:53.760
Now, as a reward for finishing training, 
I will put a magic spell on you.

00:17:53.760 --> 00:17:55.140
A spell?

00:17:55.140 --> 00:17:58.750
Imagine I have another eye here.

00:17:58.750 --> 00:18:01.370
An eye on your forehead?

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:03.990
Yes. A third eye.

00:18:05.730 --> 00:18:07.440
Ow!

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.200
Now, it is transferred to you.

00:18:09.200 --> 00:18:12.190
Transferred? The eyeball?

00:18:12.190 --> 00:18:16.200
Yes, if things happen, look with 
the eye in your forehead.

00:18:16.200 --> 00:18:17.880
Your spirit sight will activate.

00:18:19.810 --> 00:18:21.900
That is a third eye.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:23.240
A third eye?

00:18:23.330 --> 00:18:34.340
<b>Blah     Blah     Blah</b>

00:18:23.600 --> 00:18:25.710
An idea that exists across mysticisms,

00:18:25.710 --> 00:18:29.930
it's interpreted not as an organ 
of sight, but of intuition.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:34.930
By opening the third eye, you can 
gain supernatural insight.

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:36.380
I see.

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:37.920
<i>I didn't get that at all.</i>

00:18:37.920 --> 00:18:41.510
Basically, it means attaining enlightenment.

00:18:41.990 --> 00:18:44.520
That makes it sound cool!

00:18:44.800 --> 00:18:46.480
A third eye, huh?

00:18:49.510 --> 00:18:51.780
<i>A pleasant summer morning.</i>

00:18:52.740 --> 00:18:55.690
<i>Come back whenever you want, Hase.</i>

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:00.400
<i>I'm so uncomplicated...</i>

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:13.500
Yushi-kun, lunchti—

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.510
Look at your face!

00:19:20.720 --> 00:19:22.060
What is this?!

00:19:22.060 --> 00:19:23.210
Going for a new look, chirp?

00:19:23.210 --> 00:19:24.260
Looking good, chirp.

00:19:24.260 --> 00:19:25.290
Looks great, chirp!

00:19:29.540 --> 00:19:30.980
Hey, Kuri!

00:19:31.600 --> 00:19:34.330
Kuri's never played a prank before, has he?

00:19:34.330 --> 00:19:36.870
He's grown a lot more active lately, huh?

00:19:37.630 --> 00:19:41.600
He's probably influenced by the 
kid his age around here...

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:42.920
Who are you talking about?!

00:19:43.450 --> 00:19:45.120
<b>Men</b>

00:19:45.120 --> 00:19:46.960
It finally came off.

00:19:47.880 --> 00:19:50.590
Hello there, master.

00:19:50.590 --> 00:19:53.020
Hey, Fool... It's been a while.

00:19:53.020 --> 00:19:56.480
Your aura is even more beautiful than before.

00:19:56.480 --> 00:20:00.610
I can feel the increase 
in your spiritual power!

00:20:00.610 --> 00:20:01.630
Yeah?

00:20:01.630 --> 00:20:02.800
Indeed.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:05.340
The more your power grows,

00:20:05.340 --> 00:20:07.470
the more we grow, as well.

00:20:07.470 --> 00:20:11.070
The omnipotent spirit Jin, 
whom you summoned before,

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.980
has recovered and increased his strength!

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:15.820
So you Petits have powered up, too?

00:20:16.310 --> 00:20:17.820
I guess I'll try it out.

00:20:22.140 --> 00:20:23.270
Nope, never mind.

00:20:23.270 --> 00:20:24.870
Why?!

00:20:24.870 --> 00:20:26.770
I'm tired and going to bed.

00:20:26.770 --> 00:20:28.680
Master...

00:20:28.680 --> 00:20:30.040
I'm done with you.

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.560
You're no fun.

00:20:31.560 --> 00:20:32.780
<i>What a pain.</i>

00:20:32.780 --> 00:20:35.260
So, what do you want me to do?

00:20:35.260 --> 00:20:39.800
Hmm... How about Sirene's new song?

00:20:39.800 --> 00:20:40.810
New song?

00:20:41.000 --> 00:20:44.670
Thanks to you, her repertoire has increased!

00:20:44.670 --> 00:20:47.230
Oh? Then, let's try it.

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:48.840
Temperance... Sirene.

00:20:52.790 --> 00:20:56.920
Now, Sirene, let master hear your new song!

00:21:00.290 --> 00:21:01.770
Maybe this'll be good!

00:21:03.940 --> 00:21:05.560
She's just humming!

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:07.540
She learned choreography, too!

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:10.110
She didn't need to bother.

00:21:11.130 --> 00:21:13.310
<i>Should have known it'd end like this...</i>

00:21:13.690 --> 00:21:17.630
<i>After all those amazing experiences, 
I feel like I haven't changed.</i>

00:21:18.070 --> 00:21:20.910
<i>The omnipotent spirit 
Jin's power is probably...</i>

00:21:23.790 --> 00:21:25.240
700 yen?

00:21:25.240 --> 00:21:28.310
He has the same idea about money 
as I do! We're both commoners!

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.990
Why is he laughing to himself?

00:21:32.990 --> 00:21:35.680
At that age, everything is funny.

00:23:12.490 --> 00:23:15.060
This place always relaxes me so much...

00:23:15.060 --> 00:23:16.190
Right, Kuri?

00:23:16.890 --> 00:23:22.030
What's this? "All I need is 
to be with Daddy Hase"?

00:23:22.030 --> 00:23:23.830
Is that so, Kuri?!

00:23:23.830 --> 00:23:25.640
Did he really say that?

00:23:26.340 --> 00:23:29.630
Next time on <i>Elegant Yokai Apartment Life</i>:

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.390
Late Night at the Yokai Apartments.

00:23:29.630 --> 00:23:31.390
<b>Fourteenth Haunting 
Late Night at the Yokai Apartments</b>

00:23:31.940 --> 00:23:34.390
A new secret in the building's basement?

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:35.930
The landlord's amazing!
